00:23:16.208 --> 00:23:18.458
Yeah, that's
gonna be tricky. Later.

00:23:18.458 --> 00:23:20.000
And so what is it now?

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.917
- [Man 8] The car
is going to a museum

00:23:21.917 --> 00:23:23.250
and there are a lot of things,

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:26.000
but it is so huge (mumbles)

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:30.166
they cannot afford to
change all the parts (laughs).

00:23:32.458 --> 00:23:35.708
("Exjets" by Kwesi)

00:23:39.542 --> 00:23:44.208
- [Gary] Feels appropriate
to be here in People's House.

00:23:44.208 --> 00:23:47.708
People's Square in Bucharest.

00:23:47.708 --> 00:23:52.250
Huge, huge center built
by the Communist regime.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:55.375
I'd be lying if I didn't say
every time I'm in this part

00:23:55.375 --> 00:23:58.834
of the world there is some
sort of weird, chemical feels

00:23:58.834 --> 00:24:00.959
towards the
epicenter of where I'm from.

00:24:00.959 --> 00:24:04.083
But it is just a gorgeous city.

00:24:04.083 --> 00:24:06.375
These Communist
buildings can get a little dull,

00:24:06.375 --> 00:24:08.041
especially when they tore down

00:24:08.041 --> 00:24:11.458
all the incredible architecture
that was here originally.

00:24:11.458 --> 00:24:16.333
But, just an amazing trip.
An amazing group of people.

00:24:16.333 --> 00:24:19.208
Definitely a city that I
want to come back and visit,

00:24:19.208 --> 00:24:20.959
and one that I
recommend for others.

00:24:20.959 --> 00:24:23.250
Just an enjoyable
trip, DRock. You liked it?

00:24:23.250 --> 00:24:24.125
- [DRock] Yeah.
- It was fun, right?

00:24:24.125 --> 00:24:25.625
- [DRock] It was great.
- Nice little change of pace.

00:24:25.625 --> 00:24:27.250
Miss you guys. See you tomorrow.

00:24:34.667 --> 00:24:36.417
Thank you, brother.
I'll see you in the morning?

00:24:36.417 --> 00:24:37.250
- Morning.
- 4:30 A.M.?

00:24:37.250 --> 00:24:38.417
- Yes.
- Okay.

00:24:51.291 --> 00:24:52.708
I'll see you soon.

00:24:52.708 --> 00:24:54.708
- Thank you.
- Take care.

00:24:54.708 --> 00:24:55.875
- Thank you.
- [Gary] Alright, DRock.

00:24:55.875 --> 00:24:57.875
We have to get up
in like five minutes.

00:24:57.875 --> 00:24:59.125
- Talk to you soon.

00:24:59.125 --> 00:25:00.500
- I like you very much.

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:02.000
- [Gary] I like you, too.

00:25:04.583 --> 00:25:06.250
We grinded this one.

00:25:09.417 --> 00:25:12.625
("Exjets" by Kwesi)

